  "description": "An embeddable SQL database for .NET with ACID transactions, columnar storage and exact aggregates, for applications that need fast dashboards and analytics over their own data without running a server. Tables live in memory with a write-ahead log, or on disk as larger-than-memory paged tables that are checksummed, crash-safe and carry self-building summaries and indexes derived from the columns. Includes similarity search (NEAREST), NULLs, change-feed batches (ApplyChanges), and an EvalApp extension with async execution. See the package page for the full capability list.",
